WEBVTT

00:16:00.704 --> 00:16:05.537
I am a big believer in, you know, standing
on the shoulders of others,

00:16:06.037 --> 00:16:10.829
I am my ancestors, you know, from
Nigeria and Ghana, West Africa,

00:16:11.121 --> 00:16:15.246
I am their wildest dreams, you know, to
whom much is given, much is required.

00:16:15.746 --> 00:16:19.037
And so I believe that that's tattooed
on my soul and my heart.

00:16:19.787 --> 00:16:22.912
Meet Mandele Crowley. Ever
since he was a kid,

00:16:23.121 --> 00:16:26.537
Mandela is understood how important it
is to have someone in your corner.

00:16:26.871 --> 00:16:29.454
Our childhood was one where we were
raised by our grandparents.

00:16:29.454 --> 00:16:32.496
We had a little bit of adversity losing
our parents relatively early.